# Shows how Claude Code's question dialog (AskUserQuestion, which a hooks module's $.ui.ask also
# opens) renders a multi-line question with markdown in it, and snaps it as "dialog".
#
#   term-record -C "$(mktemp -d)" -s examples/ask-dialog.steps -- claude --model haiku
include claude-start.steps
paste ask-dialog.prompt
sleep 1
keys Enter
wait 'Close' 120
sleep 2
snap dialog
keys Escape
